push ebp       → Save old frame pointer
mov ebp, esp   → Make current ESP the new frame pointer
sub esp, 16    → Reserve 16 bytes for local variables
---------------------------------------------------
push ebp        = Save old FP
mov ebp, esp    = Create new FP
sub esp, N      = Make room for local variables
---------------------------------------------------

0x1234       → address/value হিসেবে সরাসরি number
[0x1234]     → ঐ address-এর ভিতরের memory value
dword_0x1234 → disassembler-এর দেওয়া DWORD variable/label
[] দেখলে প্রথমেই ভাববে: “memory-এর ভিতরের value আনছে।”
